				<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>We at DrownedMadonna.com are excited to report even additional information that we heard about <strong>Bitch I&#8217;m Madonna</strong>.</p>
<p>As we already told you both the video and the Remix Ep of <strong>Bitch I&#8217;m Madonna</strong> will come out the same day.</p>
<p>We learnt that the released date is not 100% definitive, but it will be on June 15th or 16th for sure. For both the Remix Ep and the video.</p>
<p>We also heard that <strong>Bitch I&#8217;m Madonna</strong> Remix Ep will include 10 mixes. Here is the lineup:</p>
<ol>
<li>Bitch I&#8217;m Madonna (Fedde Le Grand Remix)</li>
<li>Bitch I&#8217;m Madonna (Rosebel&#8217;s Bitch Move Mix)</li>
<li>Bitch I&#8217;m Madonna (Sander Kleineberg Remix)</li>
<li>Bitch I&#8217;m Madonna (Junior Sanchez Remix)</li>
<li>Bitch I&#8217;m Madonna (Oscar G 305 Dub)</li>
<li>Bitch I&#8217;m Madonna (Sick Individuals Remix)</li>
<li>Bitch I&#8217;m Madonna (Dirty Pop Remix)</li>
<li>Bitch I&#8217;m Madonna (Flechette Remix)</li>
<li>Bitch I&#8217;m Madonna (Oscar G Bitch Beats)</li>
<li>Bitch I&#8217;m Madonna (Rosabel&#8217;s Bitch Move Dub)</li>
</ol>
<p>Are you ready b*tches?</p>
<p>The post <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com/bitch-im-madonna-video-and-ep-release-date-tracklist/20150605">Bitch I&#8217;m Madonna video and Ep release date + tracklist</a> appeared first on <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com">Madonna news new album Rebel Heart</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
