				<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>UPDATE: <strong>DJ Thrill</strong> has just confirmed on twitter what we revealed some days ago: the <strong>Ghosttown</strong> <strong>Remix EP</strong> will be released on <strong>May 19</strong>!</p>
<blockquote class="twitter-tweet" width="550"><p lang="en" dir="ltr">The <a href="https://twitter.com/Madonna">@Madonna</a> <a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/Ghosttown?src=hash">#Ghosttown</a> Remix EP is out Mon. May 19th on <a href="https://twitter.com/Interscope">@Interscope</a> &#8211; listen to mine here &amp; look out for FREE stuff! <a href="http://t.co/sPhb6qYdSp">http://t.co/sPhb6qYdSp</a></p>
<p>&mdash; THRILL (@iamthrill1) <a href="https://twitter.com/iamthrill1/status/598903645590007808">May 14, 2015</a></p></blockquote>
<p><script async src="//platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"></script></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<hr />
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>We at DrownedMadonna.com learned that <strong>Madonna&#8217;s Ghosttown Remix Ep</strong> was moved to May 19, 2015.</p>
<p>The <strong>Ghosttown Ep</strong> was originally planned for May 12, as we announced here.</p>
<p>We also heard that <strong>Tidal</strong> will have a version with 12 remixes, which means that it will features 2 exclusive remixes.</p>
<p>Stay tuned for more&#8230;</p>
<p>The post <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com/madonna-ghosttown-ep-postponed-to/20150501">Madonna Ghosttown Ep postponed to&#8230;</a> appeared first on <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com">Madonna news new album Rebel Heart</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
