				<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>We at <strong>DrownedMadonna.com</strong> heard some brand new details about <strong>Madonna</strong>&#8216;s <strong>Ghosttown</strong> remixes and the upcoming <strong>Remixes EP</strong>.<br />
<strong>Madonna</strong> will put up three new <strong>Ghosttown</strong> remixes on her <a href="https://www.youtube.com/user/madonna/videos" target="_blank"><strong>YouTube</strong></a> official channel tomorrow. The remixes are by <strong>Offer Nissim</strong>, <strong>Mindskap</strong> and <strong>Armand Van Helden</strong>. The Offer remix is told to be epic. The Mindskap is very good and it has minimal vocals.</p>
<p>When the <strong>Behind The Scene</strong> of <strong>Ghosttown</strong> video was published, many of you asked the name of the remixes used. Well, we can tell you that the remixes are <strong>THRILL</strong> and <strong>Dj Yiannis String Intro Mix.  </strong>The Yiannis String Intro Mix is an amazing piano mix. You will love it.</p>
<p>Those both mixes will be in the <strong>Ghosttown Remixes EP</strong> that will have <strong>10</strong> remixes. It&#8217;s tentatively out on May 12.</p>
<p>Finally some mixes will be a <strong>TIDAL</strong> exclusive.</p>
<p>Stay tuned for more updates.</p>
<p>The post <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com/madonnas-ghosttown-new-remixes-tomorrow-on-youtube-ep-exclusive-details/20150428">Madonna&#8217;s Ghosttown new Remixes tomorrow on YouTube + EP Exclusive details</a> appeared first on <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com">Madonna news new album Rebel Heart</a>.</p>
